{"3932270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "My Pet Store", "steam_appid": 3932270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🐾 Open the door to a world of care and business!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>My Pet Store</strong> — a place where coziness meets dreams. Start with a small shop where every detail matters, and step by step grow it into the favorite spot for pets and their owners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌟 Immerse yourself in warmth and positivity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rush here — just bright colors, adorable pets, and a relaxing management experience that brings joy with every achievement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🐶🐱🐠 Care that’s seen and felt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your store will fill with fluffy friends and exotic pets, along with all sorts of items and accessories needed to make every little creature happy. From small investments to big ideas — every choice brings growth and development closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚀 Grow at your own pace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your story is without pressure or hurry. Explore, experiment, achieve results, and build the store of your dreams. Rewards and discoveries await those ready to move forward with love and patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>👤 Crafted with soul by a solo developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a personal project filled with sincere love for pets and care for every detail, so you feel part of a lively, kind world.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🐾 Open the door to a world of care and business!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>My Pet Store</strong> — a place where coziness meets dreams. Start with a small shop where every detail matters, and step by step grow it into the favorite spot for pets and their owners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌟 Immerse yourself in warmth and positivity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rush here — just bright colors, adorable pets, and a relaxing management experience that brings joy with every achievement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🐶🐱🐠 Care that’s seen and felt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your store will fill with fluffy friends and exotic pets, along with all sorts of items and accessories needed to make every little creature happy. From small investments to big ideas — every choice brings growth and development closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚀 Grow at your own pace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your story is without pressure or hurry. Explore, experiment, achieve results, and build the store of your dreams. Rewards and discoveries await those ready to move forward with love and patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>👤 Crafted with soul by a solo developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a personal project filled with sincere love for pets and care for every detail, so you feel part of a lively, kind world.</p>", "short_description": "🐾 Build a cozy pet store and turn it into a favorite spot for pets and their owners! Manage your shop, discover new animals and products, grow at your own pace, and enjoy the process of care and progress!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Arabic<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Hindi<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages wi